      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HEY MAC (6) produced a sharp 29.74 when placed over 515m at The Gardens last start in a Grade 4/5. Has the ability and looks hard to top. FASCINATE SUZIE (8) had been in super honest form hitting the frame two times on end before finishing eighth (31.73) at Wentworth Park last time. Solid record here including three wins. Has performed well from this box with a win and three minor placings to her name from seven starts. Leading chance. ETHANOL SECRET (3) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing fifth (35.32) in a Grade 5 at The Gardens. Has a good record at this journey. The form out of his last race has been franked. Key runner who gets his chance to atone. SMOOTH WHITE (1) is always a threat when he draws this box.",
